            "text": "theorem heatFactor_eq_profile (h : ℝ) {η X : ℝ} (hη : η ∈ Icc (-1 : ℝ) 1)\n    (hX : 0 < X) :\n    heatFactor h η X = RadialHeatProfile.profile (1 + h) (2 * (1 - η ^ 2) / X)"
